#[doc = " Outcome of a result_step call. WAITING is the 0-value, so a zero-initialized out-param reads as \"no work product yet\"\n rather than CHUNK, the same convention VECTOR_TYPE_OTHER follows. The four states are the ones a consumer acts on;\n they are deliberately not a projection of any internal enum."]
